PaymentRailsFactory_Ownership
├── when initial owner is zero address
│   └── it should revert with OwnableInvalidOwner
├── when initial owner is valid
│   ├── it should set the owner
│   └── it should not make the deployer the owner
├── when renounceOwnership is called
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRailsFactory_OwnershipCannotBeRenounced
├── when an approved operator calls transferOwnership
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── when ownership is pending and not yet accepted
│   └── it should stop the pending owner from creating or setting operators
└── when ownership is transferred
    ├── it should not change the owner until accepted
    ├── it should set and then clear the pending owner
    ├── it should let the new owner create instances
    ├── it should still reject a caller that is neither owner nor operator with PaymentRailsFactory_NotOwnerOrOperator
    ├── it should reject the previous owner with PaymentRailsFactory_NotOwnerOrOperator
    ├── it should keep operator approvals
    ├── it should let the new owner revoke an operator
    └── it should stop the previous owner from setting operators with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
